Open Agentv0.1.156 · dev-buildA self-improving AI agent for your vault.GeneralProvidersModelWorkspaceSafetyChatAppearanceCommandsProfilesCapabilitiesMemory & ContextNotificationsAutomationsAdvancedAboutCapabilitiesWhat the agent can do: built-in toolsets, learned skills, and external MCP servers.ToolsOne switch per toolset.Vault toolsread / write / edit / delete / rename notes, list files, searchWeb toolsfetch and read web pagesMemory toolssave / search long-term memory and user profileSkill toolslist and create reusable skillsAutomation toolscronjob — let the agent create and manage scheduled automationsClarify toolclarify — ask the user structured questions (choices / multi-select / free text) mid-runTodo tooltodo — the agent keeps a session task list for complex multi-step workVision toolvision_analyze — let the agent load and read images (vault file, URL, or data URL)Delegation tooldelegate_task — spawn isolated subagents; only their final summaries returnTerminal & ProcessesDesktop-only command execution with explicit consent and per-start approval.Unavailable on mobileThe plugin remains mobile-capable, but terminal/process schemas and the Node runtime are not registered on mobile.Web searchWhere the AI searches the web. DuckDuckGo is free and needs no setup; the other options need an API key or your own server.Search backendDuckDuckGo (default) needs no key. Brave/Tavily need keys; SearXNG needs its own URL. Missing credentials fall back to DuckDuckGo.DuckDuckGo (free)Brave (free-tier key)Tavily (key)SearXNG (self-hosted)Brave Search API keyFree tier at brave.com/search/api/. Stored in settings and redacted from exports.Tavily API keytavily.com. Stored in settings and redacted from exports.SearXNG instance URLe.g. http://localhost:8080. Must be http(s).SkillsSKILL.md files the agent reads and authors — the learning loop.Enable skillsSkills folderVault folder holding skill folders (each with a SKILL.md).Auto-create skillsLet the agent capture reusable procedures as skills after complex tasks (its learning loop).vault-digestCompose periodic vault digests into a note.Delete1. Collect notes modified in the window.
2. Group by folder.
3. Append to the target note.hermes-reviewStructured code review with severity tags.DeleteSeverity-tagged findings, then a summary.MCP serversExternal tool servers over the Model Context Protocol — stdio (a command) or HTTP (a URL).Enable MCPRuns configured MCP servers on this device — first-use consent explains the risk. stdio is desktop-only; HTTP connects over a URL.filesystemstdio · npx -y @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem /home/user/docsCommandExecutable spawned over stdio, e.g. npxArgumentsSpace-separated arguments passed to the command.EnvironmentKEY=VALUE pairs, one per line.remote-hubhttp · https://mcp.example.com/sse · disabledURLHTTP endpoint of this MCP server.HeadersKEY=VALUE pairs, one per line — e.g. Authorization=Bearer …Add MCP serverImport mcp.jsonPaste a standard mcp.json document below. Servers are merged by name.ImportInstall from catalogServers connect lazily on the next chat run. The catalog offers curated, pinned servers — git-installed ones clone and run third-party code on this device without a sandbox.Browse HubBundled source: kepano's Obsidian skills. Search, preview + security-scan, then one-click install into the active profile.Hubs:kepano/obsidian-skills5mycorp/team-skills1×Update allFeatured · 0 installeddefuddletrustedkepano/obsidian-skillsExtract clean markdown content from web pages using Defuddle CLI.PreviewInstalljson-canvastrustedkepano/obsidian-skillsCreate and edit JSON Canvas files (.canvas) with nodes, edges, and groups.PreviewInstallobsidian-basestrustedkepano/obsidian-skillsCreate and edit Obsidian Bases (.base files) with views, filters, and formulas.PreviewInstallobsidian-clitrustedkepano/obsidian-skillsInteract with Obsidian vaults using the Obsidian CLI.PreviewInstallobsidian-markdowntrustedkepano/obsidian-skillsCreate and edit Obsidian Flavored Markdown — wikilinks, embeds, callouts, properties.PreviewInstallrelease-checklistcommunitymycorp/team-skillsShip-prep checklist.PreviewInstallInstall from URLDirect https:// link to a SKILL.md — scanned by the Skills Guard before install.Fetch & install
